  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Welcome to Domain Draw\nThe High Monarch has fallen, and the fate of the
    realm lies uncertain. How will you defeat your rivals? How will you prevent the
    domains from falling? How will you become a champion and take your place on the
    throne? I dare you to find out\u2026\nSpecies Selection\nEach player begins by
    selecting a character species. Every character comes with 5 unique, species-specific
    cards. These cards are generally more powerful than general pool cards, but they
    often carry specific risks or negative side effects. Choose wisely each character
    has different strengths and downfalls. \nDomain Selection \nYou must choose the
    battlefield. The lower the domain's HP, the bigger the risk of your actions\u2014think
    carefully about maintaining balance!  Select a domain using the \"Next\" and
    \"Prev\" buttons, then click Choose Domain.NyxFall Expanse (Easy): Domain HP
    = 100. Total Time = 20 Minutes.Thorn Bloom Hollow (Medium): Domain HP = 80. Total
    Time = 15 Minutes.Scorch Veil Reach (Hard): Domain HP = 65. Total Time = 10 Minutes.Building
    Your DeckEach player builds a deck of exactly 15 cards. There are two ways to
    do this:Preset: Automatically generates a balanced deck using your 5 locked species
    cards and 10 random general pool cards.Build Your Own: Manually select the 10
    general pool cards to complete your deck. (Left-click to preview, right-click
    to add. Remove cards by clicking them in your deck panel).Note: Your custom deck
    is restricted by the maximum allowed limits for Attack, Defense, and Support
    cards.Gameplay & TurnsBattles are turn-based. On your turn, you will:Receive
    3 cards randomly drawn from your deck.Choose ONE Action:Play a Card: Click a
    card in your hand, then select \"Play Card\".Roll the Dice: Select a card in
    your hand to discard, then select \"Roll Dice\". Rolling an Even number damages
    your opponent. Rolling an Odd number damages you! Forfeit: Select \"Forfeit\"
    to immediately surrender the match.After your action, pass the device to your
    opponent for their turn.The Dual Health SystemA true ruler must balance power
    with control. Keep an eye on both meters:Player HP: Represents your survival.Domain
    HP: Represents the stability of the land. If you attack recklessly, you destroy
    the very throne you are trying to claim. Winning & LosingVictory: Reduce your
    Opponent's HP to 0.Defeat: Your timer reaches 0, or you choose to forfeit.Mutual
    Destruction (Draw): If the Domain HP reaches 0, the land collapses and both players
    lose"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
